# The build context is /opt/arc/comfyui/build/ on the host, which holds only
# the rendered Dockerfile, workflows/ and this file. The 121 GB model set lives
# at /opt/arc/comfyui/models and is NEVER part of the build context.
#
# This file is not decoration. Without it a stray copy of a model directory
# into the context -- by a future task, or by someone debugging a mount
# problem -- would be sent to the daemon and baked into the image. That is the
# one thing STOP RULES forbid outright.
models/
output/
input/
user/
temp/
*.safetensors
*.ckpt
*.pth
*.bin
*.onnx
